Solstice's changes began on 2026-11-22 on top of Henge commit 7b55730. Every change
is recorded in this repository's git history. In summary, Solstice:

  - picks fixes and improvements proposed to Henge by its community (each such
    commit names its origin) and adds its own;
  - reworks the translator, the multi-CPU and timer paths, the code cache, the
    memory layout, the GPU replay and the disk, network and audio devices for speed
    and lower memory use;
  - narrows the app to one guest (macOS Sequoia 15.6.1) and to devices with an A14
    or newer on iOS/iPadOS 26 or later, and removes what that does not need;
  - changes the app's name, set-up flow and settings.

